\begin{equation*}
\langle H \rangle = \frac{(\Delta p)^2}{2m} + \frac{1}{2} m\omega^2(\Delta x)^2
\end{equation*}

and the uncertainty relation forbids $\Delta p = \Delta x = 0$.

